### Lab 07: Request Validation, Centralized Error Handling & Logging
### Tested with VS Code REST Client

### 1. Valid Book Creation (Expect 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture: A Craftsman's Guide",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 680,
  "pages": 432
}

### 2. Invalid Book Creation (Missing title, negative price - Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "price": -50,
  "pages": 100
}

### 3. Trigger Centralized Error Handler (Expect 500 formatted JSON)
GET http://localhost:3000/error-trigger
Accept: application/json
